Optional system binaries
------------------------

Handy Tools can call these external programs at runtime when present; they
are detected, not bundled or redistributed, so no license text is reproduced
here. Each remains under its own license:

  - ImageMagick (`magick`) — HEIC/WebP encode, HEIC decode
  - Poppler (`pdftoppm`, `pdftotext`) — PDF render and text extraction
  - unrar — RAR extraction
  - 7-Zip (`7z`) — 7z archives

Adding a dependency? Add it to this file with its copyright and license.
